    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;VanySlash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heroine of the Melee Wizard &quot;Vany&quot; with her Partner Axe &quot;Magnus\u2162&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Magic Devices and Fight, Sexy &amp; Hot-Blooded! It is an Action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Interaction between the two. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the bar and while on their adventures, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vany and Magnus\u2162 chat about all sorts of everyday things. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great adventure while having trivial conversations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Order a Quest and Set out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust Vany's Equipment at the Base's Bar and Receive Quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's Advance the Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Quest Provides Costumes and Accessories to Dress up the Vany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Magical Tools to Enhance their Actions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance Vany and Magnus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Level up with Free Quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Free Quests that you can go Around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try out new Outfits and Actions, and earn Experience and Money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Various looks! Customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 6 Customization Slots for Costumes and Accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many Costumes from Sexy to Cool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Come On, Let's Go On an Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy &amp; Valor! Action RPG &quot;Vanyslash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Vany and Magnus in their Adventures!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;VanySlash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Heroine of the Melee Wizard &quot;Vany&quot; with her Partner Axe &quot;Magnus\u2162&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Magic Devices and Fight, Sexy &amp; Hot-Blooded! It is an Action RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Interaction between the two. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the bar and while on their adventures, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vany and Magnus\u2162 chat about all sorts of everyday things. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great adventure while having trivial conversations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Order a Quest and Set out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust Vany's Equipment at the Base's Bar and Receive Quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's Advance the Story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Quest Provides Costumes and Accessories to Dress up the Vany.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get Magical Tools to Enhance their Actions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance Vany and Magnus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Level up with Free Quests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are Free Quests that you can go Around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can try out new Outfits and Actions, and earn Experience and Money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Various looks! Customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 6 Customization Slots for Costumes and Accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many Costumes from Sexy to Cool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Come On, Let's Go On an Adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sexy &amp; Valor! Action RPG &quot;Vanyslash&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Vany and Magnus in their Adventures!</p>",
